const faqs = [
	["What's the difference between ongoing direction and project-based work?", "Ongoing direction gives you a senior AI or creative lead inside the business rhythm. Project-based work is more contained: one defined business case, one agent framework, one build or proof loop. We can help with either, but we always start by finding the scope that is actually worth doing."],
	["What counts as one active agent or use case at a time?", "One active use case means we focus on a single business problem before moving to the next. That could be a knowledge agent, reporting workflow, review process, client handover or internal tool. Focused work leads to clearer decisions and safer results."],
	["How does communication work during a project?", "We keep communication direct and practical. Most work happens through planned working sessions, shared notes and clear decision points. The aim is not more meetings; it is making sure the right people can make the right calls at the right time."],
	["How do review rounds work?", "Review is built into the process. We test the business case, the agent framework, the outputs and the governance points before anything is treated as production-ready. The work improves through evidence, not endless opinion loops."],
	["Can I pause or cancel ongoing support?", "Yes. Fractional support should fit the needs of the business. If priorities change, we can pause, reshape or stop the work cleanly. The goal is useful direction and delivery, not locking you into something that no longer fits."],
	["What if I need more support than the plan includes?", "If the work expands, we will say so early and explain why. Sometimes the right answer is a larger scope, and sometimes it is holding the line. No hidden fees, no surprise work, and no pressure to build more than the business needs."],
	["Do you only advise, or can you build the agent too?", "Both. We can define the strategy and framework, then help build the working system. That can include agent instructions, knowledge structure, review loops, interface direction, governance and implementation support."],
	["Do you work with startups?", "Yes, where the problem is real and the team is ready to work clearly. We are especially useful for ambitious scale-ups and mid-caps that need AI direction, operational clarity and practical systems without building a large internal function first."],
	["How much does a typical project cost?", "It depends on scope. A focused discovery is different from a production agent, fractional leadership seat or wider governance programme. We define the shape first, then give a clear recommendation before any larger commitment."],
	["How fast will we see progress?", "Most teams can get useful clarity quickly. A first meeting can identify whether to explore, avoid or scope next. Timelines for build work depend on access to knowledge, decision-makers, data and the level of review needed before production."],
];
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<meta name="description" content="actai.studio designs practical agentic systems from business knowledge, clear scope and governance." />
		<title>actai.studio</title>
		<style>
			:root {
				--cream: #ebe9e4;
				--paper: #f6f4ef;
				--ink: #11110f;
				--muted: #77736a;
				--dark: #131412;
				--olive: #1e291d;
				--gold: #8a6a2e;
				--lime: #dfff42;
			}

			html {
				background: var(--cream);
				scroll-behavior: smooth;
			}

			body {
				background: var(--cream);
				color: var(--ink);
				overflow-x: clip;
			}

			.glass {
				backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(1.1);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(1.1);
			}

			.nav-pill {
				box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
			}

			.site-menu {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-rows: 0fr;
				opacity: 0;
				pointer-events: none;
				transform: translateY(-0.5rem);
				transition:
					grid-template-rows 260ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
					opacity 220ms ease,
					transform 260ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
			}

			.site-menu[data-open="true"] {
				grid-template-rows: 1fr;
				opacity: 1;
				pointer-events: auto;
				transform: translateY(0);
			}

			.site-menu > div {
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.menu-icon {
				position: relative;
			}

			.menu-icon,
			.menu-icon::before,
			.menu-icon::after {
				background: currentColor;
				border-radius: 999px;
				display: block;
				height: 2px;
				transition:
					transform 200ms ease,
					opacity 160ms ease;
				width: 14px;
			}

			.menu-icon::before,
			.menu-icon::after {
				content: "";
				left: 0;
				position: absolute;
			}

			.menu-icon::before {
				top: -5px;
			}

			.menu-icon::after {
				top: 5px;
			}

			.menu-icon[data-open="true"] {
				background: transparent;
			}

			.menu-icon[data-open="true"]::before {
				transform: translateY(5px) rotate(45deg);
			}

			.menu-icon[data-open="true"]::after {
				transform: translateY(-5px) rotate(-45deg);
			}

			body[data-contact-open="true"] {
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			body[data-contact-open="true"] main,
			body[data-contact-open="true"] .nav-pill,
			body[data-contact-open="true"] .contact-trigger {
				filter: blur(11px);
				pointer-events: none;
				transform: translateZ(0);
				transition: filter 220ms ease;
				user-select: none;
			}

			.contact-trigger {
				box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
			}

			.contact-layer {
				display: grid;
				inset: 0;
				opacity: 0;
				pointer-events: none;
				position: fixed;
				transition: opacity 220ms ease;
				z-index: 80;
			}

			.contact-layer[data-open="true"] {
				opacity: 1;
				pointer-events: auto;
			}

			.contact-scrim {
				background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.52);
				inset: 0;
				position: absolute;
			}

			.contact-panel {
				align-self: stretch;
				background: #171717;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
				border-radius: 1.8rem;
				box-shadow: 0 32px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.48);
				color: white;
				justify-self: end;
				margin: 0.25rem 0.45rem 0.25rem 0;
				max-height: calc(100vh - 0.5rem);
				overflow-y: auto;
				padding: clamp(2.5rem, 3vw, 2.95rem);
				position: relative;
				transform: translateX(2rem);
				transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
				width: min(42rem, calc(100vw - 1rem));
			}

			.contact-layer[data-open="true"] .contact-panel {
				transform: translateX(0);
			}

			.contact-close {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
				border: 0;
				border-radius: 0.8rem;
				color: white;
				cursor: pointer;
				align-items: center;
				display: inline-flex;
				gap: 0.5rem;
				font: inherit;
				font-weight: 700;
				padding: 0.72rem 1rem;
				position: absolute;
				right: 1rem;
				top: 1rem;
				transform: none;
				transition:
					background 180ms ease,
					opacity 180ms ease,
					transform 180ms ease;
				z-index: 2;
			}

			.contact-layer[data-confirm-open="true"] .contact-close {
				opacity: 0;
				pointer-events: none;
			}

			.contact-close:hover {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
				transform: translateY(-0.08rem);
			}

			.contact-control {
				background: #242424;
				border: 0;
				border-radius: 0.9rem;
				color: white;
				font: inherit;
				font-weight: 700;
				min-width: 0;
				outline: 0;
				min-height: 2.75rem;
				padding: 0.84rem 1rem;
				width: 100%;
			}

			.contact-control::placeholder {
				color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
			}

			.contact-control:focus,
			.contact-option input:focus-visible + span,
			.contact-submit:focus-visible,
			.contact-close:focus-visible {
				outline: 2px solid white;
				outline-offset: 3px;
			}

			.contact-option span {
				background: #242424;
				border-radius: 999px;
				color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52);
				cursor: pointer;
				display: inline-flex;
				font-weight: 700;
				min-height: 2.85rem;
				padding: 0.78rem 1rem;
				transition:
					background 180ms ease,
					color 180ms ease,
					box-shadow 180ms ease;
			}

			.contact-option input:checked + span {
				background: white;
				box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
				color: #11110f;
			}

			.contact-submit {
				background: white;
				border: 0;
				border-radius: 0.9rem;
				color: #11110f;
				cursor: pointer;
				font: inherit;
				font-weight: 800;
				min-height: 3.15rem;
				transition:
					background 180ms ease,
					color 180ms ease,
					transform 180ms ease;
			}

			.contact-submit:hover {
				background: var(--lime);
				transform: translateY(-1px);
			}

			.contact-confirm {
				background: #1b1b1b;
				border-radius: 1.7rem;
				box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42);
				color: white;
				left: min(26rem, 34vw);
				opacity: 0;
				padding: 2.1rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
				pointer-events: none;
				position: fixed;
				text-align: center;
				top: 43%;
				transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.98);
				transition:
					opacity 180ms ease,
					transform 220ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
				width: min(22rem, calc(100vw - 2rem));
				z-index: 90;
			}

			.contact-confirm[data-open="true"] {
				opacity: 1;
				pointer-events: auto;
				transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);
			}

			.rounded-sheet {
				border-radius: 3.4rem 3.4rem 0 0;
			}

			.stack-panel {
				border-radius: 3.4rem 3.4rem 0 0;
				box-shadow: 0 -32px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
				margin-top: -5.6rem;
				position: relative;
			}

			.reveal {
				opacity: 0;
				transform: translateY(30px);
				transition:
					opacity 780ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
					transform 780ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
				transition-delay: var(--delay, 0ms);
			}

			.reveal.is-visible {
				opacity: 1;
				transform: translateY(0);
			}

			.hero-title {
				font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 7.2vw, 8.2rem);
				line-height: 1.04;
				letter-spacing: 0;
			}

			.hero-video-frame {
				height: max(100vh, calc(100vw / 1.6985));
				left: 50%;
				pointer-events: none;
				position: absolute;
				top: 50%;
				transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
				width: max(100vw, calc(100vh * 1.6985));
			}

			.hero-script {
				font-family: var(--font-sans);
				font-style: italic;
				font-weight: 400;
			}

			.feature-panel {
				background:
					radial-gradient(circle at 24% 30%, rgba(138, 106, 46, 0.78), transparent 0 34rem),
					radial-gradient(circle at 78% 20%, rgba(48, 74, 42, 0.72), transparent 0 35rem),
					linear-gradient(120deg, #4a3418, #142017 66%);
			}

			.vertical-card {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
			}

			.feature-index {
				background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
				color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.43);
				cursor: pointer;
				text-align: left;
			}

			.feature-index[data-active="true"] {
				background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.38);
				border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.36);
				box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
				color: white;
			}

			.feature-track {
				-webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
				overscroll-behavior-y: contain;
				padding-bottom: 5rem;
				padding-top: 0;
				scrollbar-width: none;
			}

			.feature-track::-webkit-scrollbar {
				display: none;
			}

			.feature-window {
				position: relative;
			}

			.feature-window::before,
			.feature-window::after {
				content: "";
				left: 0;
				pointer-events: none;
				position: absolute;
				right: 0;
				z-index: 10;
			}

			.feature-card {
				max-width: 34.75rem;
				min-height: 31rem;
				scroll-margin-top: 8rem;
				width: 100%;
			}

			@media (min-width: 1024px) {
				.feature-window {
					height: 40rem;
					overflow: hidden;
				}

				.feature-window::before {
					background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(33, 42, 26, 0.98) 0%, rgba(33, 42, 26, 0) 100%);
					height: 5rem;
					top: 0;
				}

				.feature-window::after {
					background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(36, 29, 18, 0.98) 0%, rgba(36, 29, 18, 0) 100%);
					bottom: 0;
					height: 4rem;
				}

				.feature-track {
					height: 100%;
					overflow-y: auto;
					padding-bottom: 6rem;
					padding-top: 1rem;
				}

				.feature-card {
					min-height: 31rem;
					scroll-margin-top: 2rem;
				}
			}

			.use-case-track {
				-webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
				background: transparent !important;
				box-shadow: none !important;
				scroll-snap-type: x proximity;
				scrollbar-width: none;
			}

			.use-case-track::-webkit-scrollbar {
				display: none;
			}

			.use-case-card {
				background: transparent;
				box-shadow: none;
				color: white;
				scroll-snap-align: start;
			}

			.use-case-shell {
				aspect-ratio: 15 / 16;
			}

			.use-case-card:nth-child(3n + 1) {
				--case-glow-a: rgba(255, 78, 24, 0.34);
				--case-glow-b: rgba(255, 179, 34, 0.3);
				--case-glow-c: rgba(87, 8, 23, 0.42);
				--case-haze: rgba(182, 171, 181, 0.34);
			}

			.use-case-card:nth-child(3n + 2) {
				--case-glow-a: rgba(97, 120, 255, 0.34);
				--case-glow-b: rgba(213, 136, 255, 0.28);
				--case-glow-c: rgba(20, 32, 62, 0.44);
				--case-haze: rgba(190, 199, 210, 0.34);
			}

			.use-case-card:nth-child(3n) {
				--case-glow-a: rgba(56, 213, 170, 0.3);
				--case-glow-b: rgba(237, 236, 142, 0.28);
				--case-glow-c: rgba(28, 43, 34, 0.46);
				--case-haze: rgba(179, 186, 178, 0.32);
			}

			.use-case-shell {
				background: transparent;
				box-shadow: none;
				isolation: isolate;
			}

			.use-case-art-image {
				filter: saturate(1.08) contrast(0.98);
				object-position: center 42%;
				opacity: 1;
				transform: scale(1.28);
				z-index: 0;
			}

			.use-case-texture,
			.use-case-shell::before,
			.use-case-shell::after {
				content: "";
				inset: 0;
				pointer-events: none;
				position: absolute;
			}

			.use-case-texture {
				background:
					radial-gradient(circle at 34% 40%, var(--case-glow-a) 0 11rem, transparent 24rem),
					radial-gradient(circle at 72% 36%, var(--case-glow-b) 0 9rem, transparent 22rem),
					radial-gradient(circle at 42% 74%, var(--case-glow-c) 0 11rem, transparent 23rem),
					linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03));
				filter: blur(22px) saturate(1.18);
				mix-blend-mode: screen;
				opacity: 0.28;
				transform: scale(1.14) rotate(var(--case-tilt, 0deg));
				z-index: 1;
			}

			.use-case-shell::before {
				background:
					radial-gradient(circle at 20% 92%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12), transparent 22rem),
					linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32));
				z-index: 2;
			}

			.use-case-shell::after {
				background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01) 44%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08));
				z-index: 3;
			}

			.use-case-content {
				background: transparent;
				box-shadow: none;
				height: 100%;
				z-index: 4;
			}

			.use-case-kicker {
				left: 1rem;
				position: absolute;
				right: 1rem;
				top: 1rem;
			}

			.use-case-kicker > p {
				font-size: 0.78rem;
			}

			.use-case-nav {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
				box-shadow:
					inset 0 1px 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16),
					0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
			}

			.use-case-title {
				font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.4vw, 2.3rem);
				line-height: 0.98;
				margin-inline: auto;
				max-width: 14ch;
				text-align: center;
				text-wrap: balance;
			}

			.use-case-heading {
				align-content: start;
				left: 1rem;
				max-width: none;
				min-height: auto;
				padding-top: 0;
				position: absolute;
				right: 1rem;
				top: 4.5rem;
			}

			.use-case-copy {
				font-size: clamp(0.96rem, 1.2vw, 1.08rem);
				line-height: 1.3;
				margin-inline: auto;
				max-width: 31ch;
				text-align: center;
				text-wrap: balance;
			}

			.use-case-detail {
				backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.08);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.08);
				background:
					linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)),
					rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
				bottom: 0.9rem;
				box-shadow:
					0 18px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12),
					inset 0 1px 14px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16),
					inset 0 -18px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
				display: grid;
				left: 50%;
				max-width: calc(100% - 2rem);
				min-height: 8.4rem;
				position: absolute;
				transform: translateX(-50%);
			}

			.use-case-menu-title {
				font-size: 0.78rem;
				margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
				text-align: center;
			}

			.use-case-menu-body {
				align-content: start;
				display: grid;
				font-size: 0.92rem;
				gap: 0.45rem;
			}

			.use-case-menu-row {
				align-items: center;
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
				border-radius: 0.55rem;
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				min-height: 2.05rem;
				padding: 0.48rem 0.75rem;
			}

			.use-case-menu-muted {
				padding: 0.32rem 0.75rem;
			}

			.use-case-chart {
				align-items: end;
				display: grid;
				gap: 0.35rem;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
				height: 3.2rem;
				margin-inline: auto;
				width: min(100%, 11rem);
			}

			.use-case-chart span {
				background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22));
				border-radius: 999px 999px 0.35rem 0.35rem;
				display: block;
				min-height: 0.7rem;
			}

			.use-case-status-dot {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
				border-radius: 999px;
				height: 0.48rem;
				width: 0.48rem;
			}

			.proof-card {
				background: #f7f6f2;
				border: 1px solid rgba(17, 17, 15, 0.05);
				box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(17, 17, 15, 0.05);
			}

			.proof-card:nth-child(2) {
				border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 82%, white);
			}

			.frame-layer {
				opacity: 0;
				transform: translate(-50%, calc(64% + var(--frame-peek, 0px))) scale(0.9);
				transform-origin: center;
				transition:
					opacity 920ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
					transform 620ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
				transition-delay: var(--frame-delay, 0ms);
			}

			.reveal.is-visible .frame-layer {
				opacity: 1;
				transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% + var(--frame-peek, 0px))) scale(1);
			}

			.reveal.frame-ready .frame-layer {
				transition-delay: 0ms;
			}

			.frame-stack {
				touch-action: pan-y;
			}

			.sector-grid {
				align-items: start;
				position: relative;
			}

			.sector-grid::before,
			.sector-grid::after {
				content: "";
				left: 0;
				pointer-events: none;
				position: absolute;
				right: 0;
				z-index: 4;
			}

			.sector-grid::before {
				background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f6f4ef 0%, rgba(246, 244, 239, 0.92) 36%, rgba(246, 244, 239, 0) 100%);
				height: 8rem;
				top: 0;
			}

			.sector-grid::after {
				background: linear-gradient(0deg, #f6f4ef 0%, rgba(246, 244, 239, 0.92) 36%, rgba(246, 244, 239, 0) 100%);
				bottom: 0;
				height: 8rem;
			}

			.sector-grid-dark::before {
				background: linear-gradient(180deg, #11110f 0%, rgba(17, 17, 15, 0.92) 36%, rgba(17, 17, 15, 0) 100%);
			}

			.sector-grid-dark::after {
				background: linear-gradient(0deg, #11110f 0%, rgba(17, 17, 15, 0.92) 36%, rgba(17, 17, 15, 0) 100%);
			}

			.sector-column {
				-webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
				overscroll-behavior-y: contain;
				scrollbar-width: none;
				touch-action: pan-y;
			}

			.sector-column::-webkit-scrollbar {
				display: none;
			}

			.sector-column:nth-child(2) {
				transform: translateY(5rem);
			}

			.footer-word {
				background: linear-gradient(180deg, #686868 0%, #686868 42%, rgba(104, 104, 104, 0) 92%);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				background-clip: text;
				color: transparent;
			}

			.faq-answer {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-rows: 0fr;
				transition: grid-template-rows 260ms ease;
			}

			.faq-answer > div {
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.faq-item[data-open="true"] .faq-answer {
				grid-template-rows: 1fr;
			}

			.faq-item[data-open="true"] .faq-icon {
				transform: rotate(180deg);
			}

			.cta-pill {
				transform: translateY(0);
				transition: transform 420ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
			}

			.reveal:not(.is-visible) .cta-pill {
				transform: translateY(0.45em);
			}

			.cta-line:hover .cta-pill {
				transform: translateY(-0.08em) rotate(-1.5deg);
			}

			.cta-line:hover .cta-pill-alt {
				transform: translateY(0.08em) rotate(1.5deg);
			}

			@media (max-width: 760px) {
				body[data-contact-open="true"] main,
				body[data-contact-open="true"] .nav-pill,
				body[data-contact-open="true"] .contact-trigger {
					filter: blur(7px);
				}

				.contact-trigger {
					left: 50%;
					right: auto;
					top: auto;
					bottom: 1rem;
					transform: translateX(-50%);
				}

				.contact-panel {
					align-self: end;
					border-radius: 1.6rem 1.6rem 0 0;
					margin: 0;
					max-height: 92vh;
					padding: 1.35rem;
					width: 100%;
				}

				.contact-close {
					right: 1rem;
					top: 1rem;
				}

				.contact-confirm {
					left: 50%;
					top: 50%;
				}

				.rounded-sheet {
					border-radius: 2rem 2rem 0 0;
				}

				.stack-panel {
					border-radius: 2rem 2rem 0 0;
					margin-top: -2.8rem;
				}

				.hero-title {
					font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 13vw, 4.4rem);
				}
			}

			@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
				html {
					scroll-behavior: auto;
				}

				.reveal {
					opacity: 1;
					transform: none;
					transition: none;
				}

				.frame-layer {
					opacity: 1;
					transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);
					transition: none;
				}

				.cta-pill,
				.reveal:not(.is-visible) .cta-pill,
				.cta-line:hover .cta-pill,
				.cta-line:hover .cta-pill-alt,
				.contact-panel,
				.contact-layer {
					transform: none;
					transition: none;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<header class="nav-pill fixed left-1/2 top-8 z-50 flex -translate-x-1/2 items-center gap-9 rounded-2xl bg-white/92 px-4 py-3 text-[#11110f] glass">
			<a href="/" class="flex h-8 items-center text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#11110f] no-underline" aria-label="actai.studio">
				ACTAI.STUDIO
			</a>
			<button class="grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full text-2xl leading-none" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle>
				<span class="menu-icon" data-menu-icon data-open="false" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			</button>
			<nav class="site-menu absolute left-0 right-0 top-[calc(100%+.5rem)] rounded-2xl bg-white/92 text-[#11110f] shadow-2xl glass" data-menu-panel data-open="false" aria-label="Main menu">
				<div>
					<div class="grid gap-1 p-3 font-bold">
						<a class="rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-current no-underline transition hover:bg-black/8" href="#process">Process</a>
						<a class="rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-current no-underline transition hover:bg-black/8" href="#use-cases">Use Cases</a>
						<a class="rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-current no-underline transition hover:bg-black/8" href="#direction">Direction</a>
						<a class="rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-current no-underline transition hover:bg-black/8" href="#faq">FAQ</a>
						<a class="mt-1 rounded-xl bg-[#11110f] px-4 py-3 text-center text-white no-underline transition hover:bg-[#dfff42] hover:text-black" href={bookingHref}>Book a meeting</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</nav>
		</header>

		<button class="contact-trigger fixed right-10 top-8 z-50 inline-flex h-14 items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/92 px-5 font-bold text-[#11110f] transition hover:bg-[#dfff42]" type="button" data-contact-open>
			<span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
			<span>Get in touch</span>
		</button>

		<div class="contact-layer" data-contact-layer data-open="false" aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="contact-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
			<aside class="contact-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
				<button class="contact-close" type="button" data-contact-close>
					<span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
					<span>Close</span>
				</button>
				<h2 id="contact-title" class="max-w-[12ch] text-[clamp(2.85rem,4.4vw,3.6rem)] font-bold leading-[0.98]">
					Let's put the future of your business to work.
				</h2>

				<form class="mt-10 grid gap-6" data-contact-form>
					<fieldset class="grid gap-3 border-0 p-0">
						<legend class="text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-white/48">Select type</legend>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="route" value="Project based" checked />
								<span>Project based</span>
							</label>
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="route" value="Retainer model" />
								<span>Retainer model</span>
							</label>
						</div>
					</fieldset>

					<div class="grid gap-3">
						<label class="text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-white/48" for="contact-name">Personal info</label>
						<div class="grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
							<input id="contact-name" class="contact-control" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="name" required />
							<input class="contact-control" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Email" autocomplete="email" required />
						</div>
					</div>

					<fieldset class="grid gap-3 border-0 p-0" data-project-fields>
						<legend class="text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-white/48">What we build?</legend>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="build" value="Website" checked />
								<span>Website</span>
							</label>
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="build" value="Mobile App" />
								<span>Mobile App</span>
							</label>
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="build" value="Branding" />
								<span>Branding</span>
							</label>
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="build" value="Corporate" />
								<span>Corporate</span>
							</label>
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="build" value="Other" />
								<span>Other</span>
							</label>
						</div>
					</fieldset>

					<fieldset class="grid gap-3 border-0 p-0" data-project-fields>
						<legend class="text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-white/48">Budget range</legend>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="budget" value="3-5k" checked />
								<span>3-5k</span>
							</label>
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="budget" value="5-10k" />
								<span>5-10k</span>
							</label>
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="budget" value="10k+" />
								<span>10k+</span>
							</label>
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="budget" value="Other" />
								<span>Other</span>
							</label>
						</div>
					</fieldset>

					<fieldset class="hidden gap-3 border-0 p-0" data-retainer-fields>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
							<legend class="text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-white/48">Select plan</legend>
							<a class="font-bold text-white underline underline-offset-4" href="#process">About plans</a>
						</div>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="plan" value="Standard plan" checked />
								<span>Standard plan</span>
							</label>
							<label class="contact-option">
								<input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="plan" value="Pro plan" />
								<span>Pro plan</span>
							</label>
						</div>
					</fieldset>

					<div class="grid gap-3">
						<label class="text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-white/48" for="contact-details">Project details</label>
						<textarea id="contact-details" class="contact-control min-h-[7.5rem] resize-none" name="details" placeholder="Tell us where AI could help, what is stuck, or what you want to understand." required></textarea>
					</div>

